    },
    {
      "id": "readiness",
      "title": "Readiness package",
      "when": "Week 8",
      "gives": "For the authorizing chain and the operators: the foundation decided, where every control stands, the security plan drafted, every weakness on a clock, and who runs the platform on day two."
    },
    {
      "id": "transformation",
      "title": "Transformation package",
      "when": "Week 8",
      "gives": "For the program and its leadership: what moves, in what order, through which gates, the road from today's reading to the next level, and the brief leadership needs to decide."
    },
    {
      "id": "final",
      "title": "Final package",
      "when": "Week 8",
      "gives": "The handover: what was accepted, every open item with an owner, and the sealed record over all of it."
